FeedInk

This product includes portable annotation components adapted from WebInk,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. WebInk is a project by Jasaxion:
https://github.com/Jasaxion/WebInk

FeedInk-specific adapters and modifications integrate those components with
reader-scoped content, account-isolated persistence and browser input.
Applicable license text is retained in packages/ink/LICENSE.

WebInk describes early drawing inspiration from pencil-annotation:
https://github.com/BUGdefender404/pencil-annotation
No Android application, private configuration or user data is included.
